# Python Learning Notebooks

A structured collection of **Python practice notebooks** covering core programming concepts to data science — written and executed on Google Colab from January to April 2024.

---

## Notebooks Overview

| Notebook | Topic |
|---|---|
| `Basic_python.ipynb` | Hello World, print statements, string operations |
| `Operators_24_jan.ipynb` | Arithmetic, assignment, and conditional operators |
| `31_jan_24_order_pizza_nd_list_nd_random_fns.ipynb` | Lists, random functions, pizza order program |
| `2_feb_age_prg_,_TUPPLE.ipynb` | Age calculator program, Tuples |
| `7_feb.ipynb` | For loops, FizzBuzz problem |
| `9_feb.ipynb` | While loops, break & else |
| `14_feb_FUNCTION.ipynb` | Defining and calling functions |
| `23_feb.ipynb` | Functions with return values |
| `1_march.ipynb` | Iteration with lists |
| `13_march.ipynb` | If-else conditions |
| `14_march.ipynb` | File handling — create, append, file pointer |
| `18_march_OOP.ipynb` | Introduction to OOP — classes & objects |
| `20_march.ipynb` | `__init__`, instance & class attributes |
| `22_march.ipynb` | Multiple inheritance |
| `27_march.ipynb` | Inheritance types, 4 pillars of OOP |
| `3_April.ipynb` | Encapsulation, Student class |
| `5_april_absrtract_class_nd_methods.ipynb` | Abstract classes & methods (`abc` module) |
| `8_April_(Numpy).ipynb` | NumPy basics, arrays |
| `10_April_NUMPY_&_PANDAS.ipynb` | NumPy reshape, nditer, Pandas intro |
| `12_April_GRAPH.ipynb` | Line plot, bar chart, pie chart, histogram |
| `13_APRIL_(SCATTER_PLOT,BAR_CHART,HISTOGRAM).ipynb` | Scatter plot, bar chart, histogram |

---

## Learning Timeline

| Period | Topics Covered |
|---|---|
| January 2024 | Python basics, operators, lists |
| February 2024 | Tuples, functions, loops |
| March 2024 | File handling, OOP concepts |
| April 2024 | Advanced OOP, NumPy, Pandas, Matplotlib |

---

## Topics at a Glance

```
Python/
├── Basics              ← print, variables, operators, strings
├── Data Structures     ← lists, tuples
├── Control Flow        ← if-else, for loop, while loop
├── Functions           ← defining, calling, return values
├── File Handling       ← create, read, append
├── OOP                 ← classes, objects, inheritance, encapsulation, abstraction
├── NumPy               ← arrays, reshape, iteration
├── Pandas              ← dataframes, intro
└── Matplotlib          ← line, bar, pie, histogram, scatter plots
```

---

## Libraries Used

| Library | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `NumPy` | Numerical computing, array operations |
| `Pandas` | Data manipulation and analysis |
| `Matplotlib` | Data visualization and plotting |
| `abc` | Abstract base classes |

---

## How to Run

### Open in Google Colab
Click any `.ipynb` file in this repo and hit the **"Open in Colab"** button at the top.

### Run Locally
```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/Python.git
cd Python
pip install numpy pandas matplotlib jupyter
jupyter notebook
```

---

> All notebooks were practiced during a structured Python learning course and run on Google Colab.
